# Project Documentation

This folder contains the documentation for the Public Water Fault Tracking System project.

## Folder Structure

- **research/** – Research sources, findings, and the research log.
- **proposal/** – The project proposal describing the problem, objectives, proposed solution, data source, and planned implementation.
- **presentation/** – Presentation slides explaining the project, its design, implementation, and expected results.

Additional documentation will be added as the project progresses.
